WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.920
You can swallow a mouthful of
food while hanging upside down.

2
00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:06.750
Gravity is not what moves it along.

3
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:11.940
Your gut is a tube, open at both
ends, running from mouth to anus.

4
00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:16.350
The space inside that tube is
still outside your body's cells.

5
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:20.100
A meal sitting in your
stomach has not truly got in.

6
00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:23.440
So when does a meal
actually get inside you?

7
00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:26.910
In this mission, you'll follow
a meal through four stages,

8
00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:29.030
from the first bite onwards.

9
00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:35.140
Then you'll see enzymes break large,
insoluble molecules into small, soluble ones.

10
00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:39.240
Your mission: find out when a
meal actually gets inside you.
